# TaskFlow environment reference.
# Every entry is commented so this file contains no values and can be copied safely.
# Set private credentials in Replit Secrets or an ignored local environment file.

# Database: configure one connection URL for persistence.
# DATABASE_URL — Primary PostgreSQL connection string.
# SUPABASE_DATABASE_URL — Alternative PostgreSQL connection string.

# Server/runtime settings.
# PORT — Server listening port; each service uses its built-in default when unset.
# NODE_ENV — Runtime mode (development or production).
# LOG_LEVEL — API log verbosity.
# REPL_ID — Supplied by Replit when available; do not set manually.

# Frontend dev server and API proxy.
# VITE_PORT — Frontend dev server port; uses its built-in default when unset.
# API_PORT — Local API port targeted by the Vite proxy.
# BASE_PATH — Public base path for the frontend; uses "/" when unset.

# AI provider settings for Agent Lab.
# AI_INTEGRATIONS_OPENAI_BASE_URL — OpenAI-compatible API base URL.
# AI_INTEGRATIONS_OPENAI_API_KEY — Provider credential; keep it in Secrets.
# OPENAI_BASE_URL — Optional endpoint; defaults to http://localhost:11434/v1 (Ollama).
# OPENAI_API_KEY — Optional API key; defaults to "ollama" for local Ollama.
# OPENAI_MODEL — Optional model override; defaults to qwen3.5:4b.

# CAMIN Python terminal agent settings (stored locally in ignored .env).
# Legacy aliases are also accepted: LLM_API_KEY and LLM_BASE_URL.
# AGENT_PROVIDER — Optional provider label shown in the terminal UI.
# The CLI loads this file from the directory where it was launched.

# Optional Clerk authentication.
# VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY — Frontend publishable key.
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY — Server-side secret; keep it in Secrets.

# Optional local browser-agent inputs.
# TARGET_URL — Page URL to open in the browser-agent script.
# USER_GOAL — Goal for the browser-agent script.
